# PostPylot — Platforms, Publishing & Jobs

## Auth vs Publishing

Supabase SSO (Google/GitHub/LinkedIn/Facebook) is **app login only**.  
Each platform needs separate OAuth for publishing permissions.

## Platform Requirements

| Platform | MVP Actions |
|----------|-------------|
| YouTube | OAuth, upload video + thumbnail, title/description/tags, save video ID/URL |
| TikTok | OAuth, Content Posting API, vertical 9:16, caption/hashtags, status check, anti-spam |
| LinkedIn | OAuth, text + image posts, save post ID |
| Facebook | OAuth, select Page, text + image posts, save post ID |

Use `googleapis` for YouTube. TikTok via secure HTTP (no SDK required). No browser automation.

## Video Pipeline (worker)

Topic → Script → Voice-over (Piper) → Scenes → Captions → Render (Remotion/FFmpeg) → Thumbnail → Store → Publish → Log

**YouTube:** 60–180s, 16:9, voice-over, kinetic text, captions, intro/outro, CTA.  
**TikTok:** 15–60s, 9:16, fast hook, big captions, light branding, original content.

## Image Generation (template-based)

LinkedIn quote cards, Facebook promo images, YouTube thumbnails, TikTok covers. Tools: Satori + Resvg + Sharp. No paid image APIs in MVP.

## Job Types (pg-boss)

Generate content/image/voice, render YouTube/TikTok video, publish to each platform, collect analytics, retry failed jobs.

## Automation Rules Examples

Weekly LinkedIn post, weekly YouTube video, weekly TikTok video, repurpose YouTube → TikTok, pause on low quality score, pause on expired account, no duplicate topics within 30 days.

## Notifications (MVP dashboard)

Content generated, scheduled, video rendered, published, failed, token expired, account disconnected, automation paused.

## Cost Target

$0–15/month: Supabase free tier, Vercel free tier, Gemini first, Piper TTS, template images, GitHub Actions cron.
